---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/arch.css';
---

<Layout title="Homelab Infrastructure Architecture"
        description="Production-grade homelab architecture diagram — Proxmox VE, Cloudflare Tunnel, VLAN-segmented, zero WAN port forwarding.">

  <div class="arch-header">
    <div class="arch-header-row">
      <div class="pulse-dot"></div>
      <h1>Homelab Infrastructure Architecture</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="arch-subtitle">Proxmox VE · 7 Docker Compose Stacks · VLAN-Segmented · Zero WAN Port Forwarding</p>
  </div>

  <div class="diagram">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1400 720" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <style>
        .tint-gold { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 9%, transparent); }
        .tint-green { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 9%, transparent); }
        .tint-rose { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--red) 12%, transparent); }
        .tint-subtle-gold { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 2%, transparent); }
        .tint-subtle-green { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 1%, transparent); }
        .tint-bg-gold { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-surface) 94%, transparent); }
        .tint-bg-dark { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 94%, transparent); }
        .tint-bg-darker { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 97%, transparent); }
      </style>
      <defs>
        <marker id="arr" markerWidth="12" markerHeight="8" refX="11" refY="4" orient="auto">
          <polygon points="0 0 12 4 0 8" fill="var(--text-muted)"/>
        </marker>
        <marker id="arr-g" markerWidth="12" markerHeight="8" refX="11" refY="4" orient="auto">
          <polygon points="0 0 12 4 0 8" fill="var(--green)"/>
        </marker>
        <marker id="arr-r" markerWidth="12" markerHeight="8" refX="11" refY="4" orient="auto">
          <polygon points="0 0 12 4 0 8" fill="var(--red)"/>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <rect width="1400" height="720" fill="var(--bg-surface)" rx="12"/>

      <!-- ─── Legend ─── -->
      <text x="30" y="24" fill="var(--text)" font-size="13" font-family="'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif">Legend</text>
      <rect x="30" y="33" width="14" height="10" rx="2" class="tint-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="52" y="42" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Proxmox LXC / VM</text>
      <rect x="200" y="33" width="14" height="10" rx="2" class="tint-green" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="222" y="42" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Docker compose</text>
      <rect x="360" y="33" width="14" height="10" rx="2" class="tint-rose" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="382" y="42" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Physical / security</text>
      <rect x="540" y="33" width="14" height="10" rx="2" class="tint-subtle-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3,2"/>
      <text x="562" y="42" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Cloudflare</text>

      <line x1="690" y1="38" x2="720" y2="38" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-g)"/>
      <text x="730" y="42" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Traffic flow</text>
      <line x1="850" y1="38" x2="880" y2="38" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4,3" marker-end="url(#arr-r)"/>
      <text x="890" y="42" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Security signal</text>
      <line x1="1030" y1="38" x2="1060" y2="38" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
      <text x="1070" y="42" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Network</text>

      <!-- ═══════════ COL 0: Physical ═══════════ -->
      <rect x="50" y="85" width="170" height="55" rx="8" class="tint-bg-dark" stroke="var(--border-light)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="135" y="110" fill="var(--text)" font-size="14" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Internet</text>
      <text x="135" y="130" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">Clients</text>

      <rect x="50" y="180" width="170" height="55" rx="8" class="tint-rose" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="135" y="205" fill="var(--text)" font-size="13" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Router / Firewall</text>
      <text x="135" y="223" fill="var(--red)" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">MikroTik RB450Gx4</text>

      <line x1="135" y1="140" x2="135" y2="179" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr)"/>

      <rect x="50" y="275" width="170" height="55" rx="8" class="tint-rose" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="135" y="300" fill="var(--text)" font-size="13" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">NAS Storage</text>
      <text x="135" y="318" fill="var(--red)" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">Ugreen DH2300 · NFS</text>

      <line x1="135" y1="235" x2="135" y2="274" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>

      <rect x="35" y="365" width="200" height="82" rx="6" class="tint-bg-darker" stroke="var(--border-light)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="135" y="385" fill="var(--accent)" font-size="11" font-family="'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif" text-anchor="middle">VLAN Segments</text>
      <text x="45" y="403" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">10 · User / 20 · IoT</text>
      <text x="45" y="419" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">30 · Server / 40 · Guest</text>
      <text x="45" y="435" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">99 · Management</text>

      <!-- ═══════════ COL 1: Cloudflare + Proxmox ═══════════ -->
      <!-- Cloudflare Edge container -->
      <rect x="285" y="55" width="360" height="85" rx="8" class="tint-subtle-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6,3"/>
      <text x="295" y="75" fill="var(--accent)" font-size="11" font-family="'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif">Cloudflare Edge</text>

      <rect x="295" y="85" width="155" height="30" rx="5" class="tint-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="372" y="102" fill="var(--text)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Cloudflare DNS</text>
      <text x="372" y="113" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="8" text-anchor="middle">alkamfrz.id</text>

      <rect x="465" y="85" width="155" height="30" rx="5" class="tint-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="542" y="102" fill="var(--text)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Cloudflare Tunnel</text>

      <line x1="220" y1="112" x2="294" y2="112" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr)"/>
      <text x="257" y="106" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">HTTPS</text>

      <line x1="450" y1="100" x2="464" y2="100" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arr)"/>

      <!-- Proxmox container (hosts all LXCs + VM) -->
      <rect x="280" y="160" width="365" height="460" rx="8" class="tint-subtle-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6,3"/>
      <text x="290" y="180" fill="var(--accent)" font-size="12" font-family="'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif">Proxmox VE Hypervisor</text>

      <!-- LXCs inside Proxmox -->
      <rect x="295" y="195" width="335" height="40" rx="4" class="tint-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="462" y="215" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Cloudflare Tunnel · LXC 102</text>
      <text x="462" y="228" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">cloudflared daemon, tunnel ingress</text>

      <rect x="295" y="265" width="335" height="40" rx="4" class="tint-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="462" y="285" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Reverse Proxy · LXC 101</text>
      <text x="462" y="298" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">HAProxy · SSL termination (Let's Encrypt)</text>

      <rect x="295" y="318" width="335" height="40" rx="4" class="tint-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="462" y="338" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">DNS Resolver · LXC 100</text>
      <text x="462" y="351" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">Unbound · DNSSEC · Adblock · Local zones</text>

      <rect x="295" y="371" width="335" height="40" rx="4" class="tint-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="462" y="391" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">VPN Gateway · LXC 103</text>
      <text x="462" y="404" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">Tailscale mesh · Remote admin access</text>

      <rect x="295" y="424" width="335" height="40" rx="4" class="tint-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <text x="462" y="444" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">AI Worker · LXC 104</text>
      <text x="462" y="457" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">Router · OpenCode CLI</text>

      <rect x="295" y="482" width="335" height="55" rx="5" class="tint-gold" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="462" y="506" fill="var(--text)" font-size="13" font-family="'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif" text-anchor="middle">Docker Host · VM 200</text>
      <text x="462" y="524" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">Docker engine · TLS · NFS-backed storage</text>

      <polyline points="220,207 294,207" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arr)"/>
      <text x="257" y="202" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Management</text>

      <!-- ═══════════ ROUTING ═══════════ -->
      <!-- Route 1: Tunnel — CF Tunnel → LXC 102 (↓ then → then ↓ clean elbow) -->
      <polyline points="542,115 542,145 462,145 462,194" fill="none" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-g)"/>
      <text x="550" y="155" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Tunnel</text>

      <!-- Route 2: LXC 102 → LXC 101 (↓ vertical down 25px, 30px gap) -->
      <line x1="462" y1="235" x2="462" y2="265" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-g)"/>

      <!-- Route 3: Proxy — HAProxy → Docker stacks (→ right → into stacks box) -->
      <polyline points="631,285 685,285 685,148 719,148" fill="none" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-g)"/>
      <text x="693" y="210" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Proxy</text>

      <!-- Route 4: Lua bouncer — CrowdSec → HAProxy (← left into haproxy) -->
      <polyline points="735,300 710,300 710,285 631,285" fill="none" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5,4" marker-end="url(#arr-r)"/>
      <text x="720" y="296" fill="var(--red)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace" text-anchor="end">Lua bouncer</text>

      <!-- Route 5: NFS — NAS Storage → Docker Host (→ right → into VM 200) -->
      <polyline points="220,302 265,302 265,492 294,492" fill="none" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5,4" marker-end="url(#arr-r)"/>
      <text x="275" y="404" fill="var(--red)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace" text-anchor="middle">NFS</text>

      <!-- Route 6: Docker compose — VM 200 → Docker stacks (→ right → into stacks box) -->
      <polyline points="631,506 685,506 685,502 719,502" fill="none" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arr-g)"/>
      <text x="693" y="494" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">compose</text>

      <!-- ═══════════ COL 2: Docker stacks ═══════════ -->
      <rect x="720" y="55" width="660" height="625" rx="8" class="tint-subtle-green" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6,3"/>
      <text x="730" y="75" fill="var(--green)" font-size="12" font-family="'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif">Docker Compose Stacks</text>
      <text x="730" y="93" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="10" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Run on Docker Host · Local intranet (VLAN 30)</text>

      <rect x="735" y="115" width="630" height="65" rx="6" class="tint-green" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="1050" y="138" fill="var(--text)" font-size="13" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">ArrSuite</text>
      <text x="1050" y="155" fill="var(--text-secondary)" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">qBittorrent · Radarr · Sonarr · Prowlarr · Bazarr · flaresolverr</text>
      <text x="1050" y="172" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="9" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace" text-anchor="middle">Media automation</text>

      <rect x="735" y="195" width="630" height="60" rx="6" class="tint-green" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="1050" y="218" fill="var(--text)" font-size="13" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Jellyfin + Seerr</text>
      <text x="1050" y="238" fill="var(--text-secondary)" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">Media server · Request management</text>
      <text x="1050" y="252" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="9" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace" text-anchor="middle">Local streaming</text>

      <rect x="735" y="270" width="630" height="60" rx="6" class="tint-rose" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="1050" y="293" fill="var(--text)" font-size="13" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">CrowdSec IPS</text>
      <text x="1050" y="313" fill="var(--text-secondary)" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle">Intrusion prevention · Lua bouncer → HAProxy</text>
      <text x="1050" y="327" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="9" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace" text-anchor="middle">Security</text>

      <rect x="735" y="350" width="300" height="60" rx="6" class="tint-green" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="885" y="373" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Homepage</text>
      <text x="885" y="393" fill="var(--text-secondary)" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">Dashboard</text>

      <rect x="1065" y="350" width="300" height="60" rx="6" class="tint-green" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="1215" y="373" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">UptimeKuma</text>
      <text x="1215" y="393" fill="var(--text-secondary)" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">Uptime monitoring</text>

      <rect x="735" y="425" width="300" height="60" rx="6" class="tint-green" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="885" y="448" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Upsnap</text>
      <text x="885" y="468" fill="var(--text-secondary)" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">Wake-on-LAN</text>

      <rect x="1065" y="425" width="300" height="60" rx="6" class="tint-green" stroke="var(--green)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <text x="1215" y="448" fill="var(--text)" font-size="11" font-family="'DM Sans',sans-serif" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle">Watchtower</text>
      <text x="1215" y="468" fill="var(--text-secondary)" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">Auto-updater</text>

      <text x="735" y="530" fill="var(--text-muted)" font-size="9" font-family="'DM Mono',monospace">Stacks share NAS volumes: configs, media, databases</text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="arch-cards">
    <div class="arch-card">
      <div class="arch-card-hdr"><div class="dot dot-gold"></div><h3>Proxmox Instances</h3></div>
      <ul>
        <li>Hypervisor (VLAN 99)</li>
        <li>Cloudflare Tunnel · LXC 102 (VLAN 30)</li>
        <li>Reverse Proxy · LXC 101 (VLAN 30)</li>
        <li>DNS Resolver · LXC 100 (VLAN 30)</li>
        <li>VPN Gateway · LXC 103 (VLAN 99)</li>
        <li>AI Worker · LXC 104 (VLAN 30)</li>
        <li>Docker Host · VM 200 (VLAN 30)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="arch-card">
      <div class="arch-card-hdr"><div class="dot dot-green"></div><h3>7 Docker Compose Stacks</h3></div>
      <ul>
        <li>ArrSuite — qBittorrent, Radarr, Sonarr, Prowlarr, Bazarr, flaresolverr</li>
        <li>Jellyfin + Seerr — Media server + request manager</li>
        <li>CrowdSec — IPS, Lua bouncer → HAProxy</li>
        <li>Homepage — Dashboard</li>
        <li>UptimeKuma — Uptime monitoring</li>
        <li>Upsnap — Wake-on-LAN</li>
        <li>Watchtower — Auto-updater</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="arch-card">
      <div class="arch-card-hdr"><div class="dot dot-rose"></div><h3>Security Posture</h3></div>
      <ul>
        <li>Zero WAN port forwarding — Cloudflare Tunnel only</li>
        <li>Let's Encrypt DNS-01 challenge (no HTTP-01)</li>
        <li>CrowdSec IPS — Lua bouncer on HAProxy</li>
        <li>Tailscale VPN mesh for remote admin</li>
        <li>VLAN segmentation (10/20/30/40/99)</li>
        <li>Unbound DNSSEC + adblock at network edge</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="arch-footer">Homelab Infrastructure · home.alkamfrz.id · Infrastructure-as-Code (Bash)</p>
</Layout>
